unit main
  @11 read tt:ttA find n/a once index ixK eq=1 (unique-equality)
  @12 read tt:ttA find n/a once index ixV whole-index (primary)
  @13 read tt:ttB find n/a once index default whole-index (primary)
  @14 read tt:ttC find n/a once index CustNum eq=1 (unique-equality)
  @15 read tt:ttA for n/a once index ixV whole-index (primary)
  @16 read Customer find no-lock per-row index CustNum eq=1 (unique-equality)
